 "head": {
  "text": "WF-002: backpressured transfer, i_ack delayed four destination cycles"
 },
 "foot": {
  "text": "The source holds reg_req high and holds o_req and D0 while i_ack is late; there is no timeout and no loss. The acknowledge then crosses in two source cycles and the cycle closes normally."
